  "details": "Every time you want to use a video player, URL link, listen to a world with background music, or, for example play “Udon Saber” by ちしゃねこ in VRChat, it can happen that the player suddenly stops working due to a “stream error,” unsupported link, or URLs not being available, and so on.\n\nThis is absolutely ridiculous because the error is caused by \"yt-dlp.exe\" ( found in = C:\\Users\\\"USERNAME\"\\AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\VRChat\\Tools , which allows you to watch and listen to videos from YouTube in VRChat. However, this little tool is very buggy and doesn't work anymore or is just to unstable for vrchat.\n\nThis problem has been around since 2024 and it's causing me to no longer enjoy the game as I used to and to stop playing it if this dosent change. PLEASE FIX THIS PROBLEM or use a different GitHub project other than yt-dlp.",
